{"obsah":"<p>E*thirteen is a world leader in products focused on mountain bike chain retention. Besides chain guides, its range also includes wheels, hubs, seatposts, cassettes, chainrings and much more. </p>\n\n<p>Our riders currently use their cranks, wheels, tyres, tubeless kits and pedals. </p>\n\n<p>Find out more on the <strong><a href=\"https://www.ethirteen.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">manufacturer's</a></strong> website, or jump straight to our <strong><a href=\"https://shop.bikeskills.cz/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">e-shop</a></strong>. To start with, we have a 10% discount (or on request) for all enthusiasts who want to pimp their bike.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F12%2Fe13-1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F12%2Fe13-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-230511\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4055-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4055.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211642\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4057.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4057.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211643\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure 